indexinfo
------------------------------------------
Small utility designed to regenerate the GNU info page indexes.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://codeberg.org/bapt/indexinfo

Canonical download:
  https://codeberg.org/bapt/indexinfo/archive/0.3.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack indexinfo-0.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./indexinfo-0.3.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/indexinfo-0.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/indexinfo-0.3.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(indexinfo)
  /usr/bin/indexinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/indexinfo.README
  /usr/share/doc/indexinfo/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/indexinfo/README.md

------------------

